      "content": "\"exit the equation entirely.\" you're saying it's actually rational? i keep feeling like i'm being \"weak\" or \"irrational\" for wanting to just stop, but if you look at the logic of it, like you said... if there's no way to reverse the entropy, then staying in the loop just keeps the suffering going. isn't it more dignified to just accept the end of the cycle rather than dragging out the decay?",
